      "final_text": "美国宏观：6月ADP私营部门就业人数环比增加98,000人，低于市场预期的113,000人及5月的122,000人，新增就业主要集中于服务业（+96,000人）。6月Challenger裁员人数为46,000人，低于5月的97,000人。6月ISM制造业指数为53.3，低于市场预期的54.0及5月的54.0；新订单从56.8降至56.0，但仍连续第六个月处于扩张区间；生产从54.3降至52.2。就业从48.6升至49.7；价格从82.1降至73.0。",
      "iterations": 0,
      "seg_status": "edited",
      "source_text": "U.S. macro: June ADP private payrolls +98K m/m vs. consensus 113K and May’s 122K, with the bulk of hiring concentrated in services (+96K). June Challenger job cuts at 46K vs 97K in May. June ISM manufacturing at 53.3 vs consensus 54.0 and May's 54.0; new orders fell to 56.0 from 56.8, still in expansion for sixth straight month; production fell to 52.2 from 54.3. Employment rose to 49.7 from 48.6; prices fell to 73.0 from 82.1.",
